// The end of a message, as functions of the context (FIPS 180-4 §5.1.1,
// issues/sha256-context-type.md): the padding and the length, over the
// block's bytes of `sha256_filling.hthr`.
//
// What the `runtime` generator reads (issues/runtime-generator-imports.md).
